nt","gender":"both","legacyNames":["The healing PC on Elm's desk"]},{"id":"61-5","name":"Scene When You Come Back From The Errand","events":["NBT-EVT-061-03"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-03]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-5-0","condition":"stage F, the first time you walk into the lab after visiting Mr. Pokémon. You are walked in and an officer turns to you.","stages":["F"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-03a","NBT-DLG-061-03b","NBT-DLG-061-03m","NBT-DLG-061-03c","NBT-DLG-061-03d","NBT-DLG-061-03e","NBT-DLG-061-03f","NBT-DLG-061-03g","NBT-DLG-061-03n","NBT-DLG-061-03h","NBT-DLG-061-03o","NBT-DLG-061-03i","NBT-DLG-061-03j","NBT-DLG-061-03k","NBT-DLG-061-03p","NBT-DLG-061-03l","NBT-DLG-061-03q"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Who are you?\nWe are investigating the case of the\n\nmissing Pokémon here...\n\nRule number one!\n\"Whoever did it will come\n\nback to the site.\"\n\nOh my... So you must be...\nthe one who did it?","id":"61-5-0-block-0","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Your friend runs in.","id":"61-5-0-block-1","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"(boy player, probably)","id":"61-5-0-block-2","gender":"male"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: Hold on a second!\nHe has nothing to do with it!\n\nI saw it.\nThere was a red-haired boy\n\nlooking into the building!","id":"61-5-0-block-3","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"61-5-0-block-4","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ethan: Hold on a second!\nShe has nothing to do with it!\n\nI saw it.\nThere was a red-haired boy\n\nlooking into the building!","id":"61-5-0-block-5","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"What?\nYou battled a boy like that?\n\nHe must be the one who did it...\nDid you happen to get his name?","id":"61-5-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"The naming screen opens and you type your rival's name.","id":"61-5-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"I see! So [Rival] was\nhis name.","id":"61-5-0-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"You are asked Yes or No. Yes: the officer thanks you and leaves. No: he asks again and the naming screen reopens, until you say Yes.","id":"61-5-0-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Thanks for helping my investigation!\n\nMy next assignment is to search for\nthis red-haired individual.","id":"61-5-0-block-10","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"If you said No:","id":"61-5-0-block-11","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"That’s not it?\n\nThen can you tell me\nwhat the name was?","id":"61-5-0-block-12","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"After the officer leaves, your friend speaks and walks out. Boy and girl players hear the same words except the name: Lyra for a boy player, Ethan for a girl player (probably).","id":"61-5-0-block-13","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player]!\nI’m glad they understand you are\n\ninnocent.\n\nSee you later!","id":"61-5-0-block-14","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"Elm turns to you. The Mystery Egg is taken from your Bag. Boy and girl players hear the same words.","id":"61-5-0-block-15","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: [Player], this\nis terrible...\n\nOh, yes, what was Mr. Pokémon’s\nbig discovery?","id":"61-5-0-block-16","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"[Player] handed the Mystery Egg\nto Professor Elm.","id":"61-5-0-block-17","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Huh?\nThis is an...Egg, isn’t it?\n\nThis Egg may be something I’ve never\nseen...still it’s just an Egg.\n\nMr. Pokémon is always fascinated\nby Eggs.\n\nWell, since he gave it to us, we might\nas well find out what secret it holds.\n\nI’ll keep it for a while to find out\nabout the Egg.","id":"61-5-0-block-18","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: What?!\n\nProfessor Oak gave you a Pokédex?\n\n[Player], is that true? Th-that’s\nincredible!\n\nHe is superb at seeing the potential\nof people as Trainers.\n\nWow, [Player].\nI knew you were a little different.\n\nThings are going to be fun!\n\nYour Pokémon seem to really like you,\nso why don’t you...take the\n\nPokémon Gym challenge?\n\nIf you manage to defeat all the\nGym Leaders, you’ll eventually\n\nchallenge the Pokémon League\n\nChampion!\n\n...Or not! Ha ha!\n\nBecoming the Champion is not at all\neasy, but you can certainly\n\nchallenge Violet City’s Gym.","id":"61-5-0-block-19","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"...[Player]. Challenging the\nGyms scattered around will be\n\na long journey.\n\nBefore you leave, make sure\nthat you talk to your mom.","id":"61-5-0-block-20","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"The scene plays once.","id":"61-5-0-block-21","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"officer ow1","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3; 543 m23"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03b","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Lyra\"","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3; 543 m24"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03m","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Ethan\"","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3; 543 m25"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03c","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"officer","trigger":"scene, before naming screen","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3; 543 m26"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03d","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"officer","trigger":"name confirm Yes/No","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m27"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03e","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"officer","trigger":"after Yes in 03d","condition":"answer Yes","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m28"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"officer","trigger":"after No in 03d (F#13)","condition":"answer No","source":"843 F#13; 543 m29"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03g","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Lyra\"","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m30"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03n","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Ethan\"","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m31"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03h","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m32"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03o","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m33"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03i","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"narration (Egg handed over)","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m34"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03j","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m35"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03k","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m36"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03p","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m37"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03l","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m38"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-03q","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"scene; female","condition":"var 0x4108=3","source":"843 S#3,F#12; 543 m39"}]}],"kind":"scene","gender":"both","legacyNames":["Scene when you come back from the errand"]},{"id":"61-6","name":"The Aide's News About The Thief","events":["NBT-EVT-061-16"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-16]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-6-0","condition":"probably stage H (after Dragon's Den), the first time you walk into the lab after that. The aide walks up to you, then goes back to his place. If this and the eight-badges scene below could both play, this one comes first.","stages":["H"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-16a"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"[Player]!\nGuess what!\n\nThe person who took the Professor’s\nPokémon has...come back to return it!\n\nThat’s the last thing I expected!\nGuess what Professor Elm said to him.\n\n...\n\"It seems that your Pokémon already\nlikes you so much.\n\nFor a Pokémon, the best happiness is\nto be with someone it loves.\n\nI think it should stay with you.\"\n\n...\nIsn’t it moving? It made me cry!","id":"61-6-0-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-16a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"aide","trigger":"scene","condition":"var 0x40FC=2","source":"843 S#16; 543 m56"}]}],"kind":"element","gender":"both","legacyNames":["The aide's news about the thief"]},{"id":"61-7","name":"Scene When You Come Back With Eight Badges","events":["NBT-EVT-061-15"],"context":"[NBT-EVT-061-15]\n\n","points":[{"id":"61-7-0","condition":"probably stage H, the first time you walk into the lab then. Your friend walks up to you.","stages":["H"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-15a","NBT-DLG-061-15f","NBT-DLG-061-15b","NBT-DLG-061-15g","NBT-DLG-061-15c","NBT-DLG-061-15h","NBT-DLG-061-15d","NBT-DLG-061-15i","NBT-DLG-061-15e","NBT-DLG-061-15j"],"blocks":[{"type":"note","text":"(boy player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-0","gender":"male"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-1","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"(girl player, probably)","id":"61-7-0-block-2","gender":"female"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Ethan: [Player]!\nDid you already collect eight Badges?\n\nThat’s so cool!\n\nThe professor is waiting\nfor you.","id":"61-7-0-block-3","gender":"female"},{"type":"note","text":"You both walk up to Elm. Boy and girl players hear the same words from him. You receive a Master Ball; if your Bag is full you do not get it, the same lines still play, and it is not offered again.","id":"61-7-0-block-4","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hi, [Player]!\nYou never cease to amaze me!\n\nThanks to you, my research is\ngoing great!\n\nTake this as a token of my\nappreciation.","id":"61-7-0-block-5","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"These two are probably Elm too (no name is shown):","id":"61-7-0-block-6","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"The Master Ball is the best!\n\nIt’s the ultimate Poké Ball! It’ll catch\nany Pokémon without fail.\n\nIt’s given only to noted\nPokémon researchers.\n\nI think you can make much better\nuse of it than I can, [Player]!","id":"61-7-0-block-7","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"By the way...\n\nWe just had a group of beautiful\nKimono Girls looking for you.","id":"61-7-0-block-8","gender":"both"},{"type":"note","text":"Your friend steps up to you, then walks out. Boy and girl players hear the same words except the name (Lyra for a boy player, Ethan for a girl player, probably).","id":"61-7-0-block-9","gender":"both"},{"type":"dialogue","text":"Lyra: [Player], people are talking\nabout you!\n\nI heard you helped Kimono Girls?\n\nYou’ve been helping all these people!\nYou make me proud to be your friend.","id":"61-7-0-block-10","gender":"male"},{"type":"note","text":"Elm ends the scene with his Kimono Girls line (\"The Kimono Girls are waiting for you at the Ecruteak Dance Theater.\", under \"Professor Elm\" below).","id":"61-7-0-block-11","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15a","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"friend \"Lyra\"","trigger":"scene; male","condition":"var 0x4108=8","source":"843 S#15; 543 m58"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-15f","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"