both"}],"uncertain":false,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01b","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#2 and F#35)","condition":"as 01a, or F#5 path without badge 15","source":"843 F#2,#35; 543 m73"},{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01ah","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"as 01b; female","condition":"as 01b","source":"843 F#2,#35; 543 m74"}]},{"id":"61-11-7","condition":"stage I, probably after the Bell Tower or the Whirl Islands (either is enough), before the S.S. Ticket.","stages":["I"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01o"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: Hahaha... Good job!\n\nThat Egg that appeared to be rare has\nbrought you so much trouble, I guess.\n\nThe Kimono Girls said something\nabout me?\n\nI don’t have anything to do with it.\n\nYou made up your mind yourself\nand went through with your decision.\n\nHaving achieved such a thing,\nyou should be able to take on\n\nthe Pokémon League now!\n\nYou should head for the\nIndigo Plateau!\n\nDo you know how to get there?\nFollow Route 27 to reach Route 26.\n\nOnce you get there, go straight north!","id":"61-11-7-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01o","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#36)","condition":"badge 15 not held, flag 242 clear, 264 or 265 set","source":"843 F#36; 543 m70"}]},{"id":"61-11-8","condition":"you have a particular earlier badge (which one is not confirmed), before stage I. It also ends the eight-badges scene.","stages":["I"],"ids":["NBT-DLG-061-01p"],"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","text":"Professor Elm: The Kimono Girls are\nwaiting for you at the\n\nEcruteak Dance Theater.","id":"61-11-8-block-0","gender":"both"}],"uncertain":true,"evidence":[{"id":"NBT-DLG-061-01p","type":"Dialogue variant","area":"61 Elm lab","speaker":"Elm","trigger":"talk (F#37) and end of EVT-061-15","condition":"badge 15 not held, 264/265 clear, badge 7 held","sou